config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_417_UMCA_GD32
	bool "UMCA GD32 UART node"
	default n
	depends on UMCA_PROFILE_DISCOVERY
	select UMCA_BUILD_UART
	---help---
		Build the UMCA Agent/control node for GD32F470V-START. The
		default UMCA link is UART3 on PC10/TX and PC11/RX, exposed as
		/dev/ttyS1 when USART0 remains the NSH console. A device-path override
		can still be supplied at runtime for diagnostics. Sensor, actuator and
		ESP32-S3 LLM gateway peers share this link through the ESP32 gateway.

if LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_417_UMCA_GD32

